{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with transformer aggregation, replacing avgpool from config_003. Validation accuracy (0.652970) and F1 (0.628258) show a slight improvement over the avgpool baseline (0.650124 accuracy), suggesting transformer aggregation may offer marginal gains. However, the small performance difference could reflect experimental noise, and the broader impact of aggregation methods remains uncertain without further comparative analysis. The role of other design choices and multimodal interactions is still unexplored."
}

